WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.415
Read, calculate and print using a compiled language.

00:00:04.415 --> 00:00:08.330
Use double for fractional dimensions and reject invalid input.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.421
Which header provides std::cout?

00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:17.170
The C++ iostream header declares standard stream objects such as std::cout.
